<mxfile host="generate.py" type="device"><diagram id="stacks" name="stacks"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1930" pageHeight="760" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t15" value="&lt;b&gt;CDK stacks: AwxSpine, one AwxKitK&amp;lt;N&amp;gt; per kit, AwxAgentStack&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontSize=18;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1890" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g16" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#545B64;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="88" width="470" height="652" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t17" value="&lt;b&gt;Deploy order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ol style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:20px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;AwxSpine&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AwxKitK1 to AwxKitK8 (independent of each other)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AwxAgentStack&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;An arrow points from a stack to the stack whose CloudFormation exports it imports. No kit stack imports from the agent stack, so the agent stack deploys last.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stack sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;infra/app.py&lt;/font&gt;: builds every stack&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;infra/stacks/&lt;/font&gt;: AwxSpine, the generic KitStack, AwxAgentStack&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;infra/constructs/kit_workflow.py&lt;/font&gt;: one state machine per kit action&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;infra/kit_manifest.py&lt;/font&gt;: loads each kit's manifest in a subprocess, so kit code never runs in the CDK process&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;A kit writes no CDK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Its manifest comes from its Python package: workflow specs (SPECS), tools (TOOLS), reads (READS), extra functions (FUNCTIONS, kit 4 only) and operator commands&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each action becomes a Step Functions Standard machine named &lt;font face='monospace'&gt;awx-&amp;lt;kit&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;action&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;; a fan-out action also gets &lt;font face='monospace'&gt;awx-&amp;lt;kit&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;action&amp;gt;-child&lt;/font&gt; (kit 6 only)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each tool becomes an entry in the kit's Gateway target in AwxAgentStack&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Call permissions (IAM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only the kit state machine roles may invoke the adapter Lambda&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only the adapter and the readers may read the Airwallex secret&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A kit's tool Lambda may invoke only its own reader and start only its own machines&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Runtime role can invoke Bedrock models; it has no Lambda, Step Functions, DynamoDB or secret access&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1452" y="96" width="446" height="636" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxSpine (shared, deployed first)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Amazon Cognito user pool: requester and approver groups, app client, pre-token Lambda adding the tenant claim&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Approval API: Amazon API Gateway HTTP API with a Cognito JWT authorizer; routes GET /proposals, GET /proposals/{proposal_id}, POST /proposals/{proposal_id}/decision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Approval Lambda: binds a decision to the proposal hash, then sends the task token&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mutation adapter Lambda: the only path to an Airwallex write endpoint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reader Lambdas, one per kit: GET only, per-kit allowlist&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AWS Secrets Manager secret: Airwallex client credentials (adapter and readers only)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Amazon DynamoDB tables: operations, proposals, decisions, tenants, ledger, audit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Amazon S3 artifacts bucket (evidence under evidence/)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AWS KMS customer managed key&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Amazon CloudWatch alarms (adapter and reader errors and throttles) to an Amazon SNS topic; AWS Budgets monthly cost budget&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E6;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="110" width="330" height="600" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g2" value="Kit stacks: one generic KitStack per kit, built from the kit's manifest" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#E7157B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="110" width="640" height="600" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK1 (kit 1, treasury)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: lock_rate, execute_plan, release_obligation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="432" y="140" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b4" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK2 (kit 2, purchase)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: issue_card, update_card_controls, freeze_card, unfreeze_card, close_card, run_limit_test&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="140" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b5" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK3 (kit 3, incident)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: replace_failed_transfer, close_incident, simulate_transfer_failure&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="432" y="281" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b6" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK4 (kit 4, dispute)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: accept_dispute, challenge_dispute, refer_dispute, close_dispute, clear_dispute_response; evidence upload Lambda&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="281" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b7" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK5 (kit 5, platform spend)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: register_shortfall, bridge_shortfall, reconcile_bridge, collect_fee, collect_repayment, issue_card, simulate_card_spend&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="432" y="422" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b8" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK6 (kit 6, payroll)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Root machines: run_payroll, lock_rates, release_run_claim; child machines: run_payroll-child, lock_rates-child&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="422" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b9" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK7 (kit 7, lending)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: collect_weekly_repayment, disburse_advance, reconcile_portfolio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="432" y="563" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b10" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxKitK8 (kit 8, settlement)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Machines: settle_seller_cycle, recalculate_seller_reserve, recover_shortfall, reconcile_seller_money, resolve_in_flight_money&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one kit-step Lambda per action (no Airwallex secret)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch alarms on its state machines (failed, timed out)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="563" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b11" value="&lt;b&gt;AwxAgentStack (deployed last)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime: the Strands agent, Cognito JWT inbound auth, Bedrock model invocation only&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AgentCore Gateway (MCP protocol, Cognito JWT inbound auth)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Gateway REQUEST interceptor Lambda: writes the verified caller into each tool call&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Gateway targets, one tool Lambda per kit (read and propose only): invokes its kit's reader, starts its kit's state machines, reads only its kit's ledger rows and the shared tenants and proposals tables&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Outputs: Runtime ARN, Gateway URL, approval API URL, user pool client id, Region (read by the awxpoc CLI)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E6F6F4;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="110" width="300" height="600" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="kitgroup" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="110" width="640" height="600" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="imports&lt;br&gt;spine&lt;br&gt;exports" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="kitgroup" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="imports&lt;br&gt;machine&lt;br&gt;ARNs" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b11" target="kitgroup"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="imports spine exports" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b11" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1270" y="85"/><mxPoint x="195" y="85"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>